**Signal Strategy**:
1. Introduce whole pizzas.
2. Animate cutting P1 into 2, then highlight 1 slice.
3. Animate cutting P2 into 4, then highlight 2 adjacent slices.
4. Extract highlighted slices, move them to center, align them to show equal area.
5. Overlay equality symbol and fraction equation.
**Overflow Prevention**: Two pizzas + labels fit comfortably in CONTENT zone. Footer text will be concise. All transformations are in-place or involve moving objects to the center, not stacking.
